# A member's own settings never belong in this repo — not their dials, not their mute
# list, not their server URL. They live in the harness's own durable state (see the
# skill's "Your member's settings" section). These patterns are a backstop in case an
# agent puts one here anyway.
humanest.local.md
member.md
.humanest/
*.local.md

# Eval output, once `claude plugin eval` is generally available
evals/results/
